WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:32.655
The king's mother came for a visit.

2
00:00:32.656 --> 00:00:34.892
"Dirk!" said the king.

3
00:00:34.892 --> 00:00:39.334
"Make sure the royal grandmother is happy."

4
00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:46.336
"Of course," said Dirk.

5
00:00:46.336 --> 00:00:49.745
But the royal grandmother was never happy.

6
00:00:49.745 --> 00:01:08.620
"My throne is too small!" she said.

7
00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:11.544
"I need a guard for my room.

8
00:01:11.544 --> 00:01:14.767
Where is my feast?"

9
00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:20.378
"Dirk!" yelled the king. "Do something!"

10
00:01:20.378 --> 00:01:24.068
Dirk ran to Tom's room.

11
00:01:24.068 --> 00:01:28.670
He pounded on the door. "Wizard!"

12
00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:30.886
"Uh-oh," thought Tom.

13
00:01:30.886 --> 00:01:34.077
"Help the royal grandmother," Dirk ordered.

14
00:01:34.077 --> 00:01:39.098
"Make sure she is happy!"

15
00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:42.193
Tom ran to find the royal grandmother.

16
00:01:42.193 --> 00:01:43.726
Dirk grinned.

17
00:01:43.726 --> 00:01:47.434
"No one can make the royal grandmother happy.

18
00:01:47.434 --> 00:01:57.554
Soon the king will throw Tom in the Grim Dungeon!"

19
00:01:57.554 --> 00:02:00.669
The royal grandmother frowned at Tom.

20
00:02:00.669 --> 00:02:04.217
"I need a bigger throne, Wizard!"

21
00:02:04.217 --> 00:02:07.022
Tom waved his wand.

22
00:02:07.022 --> 00:02:12.788
Poof! The throne grew bigger.

23
00:02:12.788 --> 00:02:16.345
Boom! The ceiling crashed down.

24
00:02:16.345 --> 00:02:19.824
"Oops!" Tom said, waving his hand.

25
00:02:19.824 --> 00:02:23.563
The throne got small again.

26
00:02:23.563 --> 00:02:28.668
"You are a terrible wizard," the royal grandmother snapped.

27
00:02:28.668 --> 00:02:35.236
"Now my bed is covered with dust.

28
00:02:35.236 --> 00:02:37.014
Look at my nightcap!

29
00:02:37.014 --> 00:02:39.108
It's a mess."

30
00:02:39.108 --> 00:02:48.183
"I will get you a new nightcap," Tom said.

31
00:02:48.183 --> 00:03:00.199
He ran to the market.

32
00:03:00.199 --> 00:03:04.056
He bought a nightcap from a man.

33
00:03:04.056 --> 00:03:07.982
"Hmm . . ." Cat sniffed the nightcap.

34
00:03:07.982 --> 00:03:10.706
"It smells like magic."

35
00:03:10.706 --> 00:03:16.489
Tom laughed. "Don't be silly, Cat.

36
00:03:16.489 --> 00:03:22.951
It's just a nightcap!"
